{"id":"77d24244d8465676","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3AtomRow.md","title":"L3AtomRow","display":"L3AtomRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3AtomRow","parameters":["z4805","z4806","z4807"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3AtomRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z4805</span><span>z4806</span><span>z4807</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>z4805</code>、<code>z4806</code>、<code>z4807</code>。</p>\n<p>相关原子索引。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3AtomRow z4805 z4806 z4807)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists n\n  (exists a\n    (and\n      (@ Pair n a z4807)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat n)\n        (and\n          (@ FmL a)\n          (or\n            (@ PAtom n a)\n            (or\n              (exists z4810\n                (and\n                  (@ PNeg z4810 a)\n                  (exists z4812\n                    (exists z4813 (and (in z4812 z4806) (and (@ App z4805 z4812 z4813) (@ Pair n z4810 z4813)))))))\n              (exists z4810\n                (exists z4811\n                  (and\n                    (@ PImp z4810 z4811 a)\n                    (or\n                      (exists z4814\n                        (exists z4815 (and (in z4814 z4806) (and (@ App z4805 z4814 z4815) (@ Pair n z4810 z4815)))))\n                      (exists z4816\n                        (exists z4817 (and (in z4816 z4806) (and (@ App z4805 z4816 z4817) (@ Pair n z4811 z4817))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2599832c1bfb4f3c\" href=\"?note=2599832c1bfb4f3c\" title=\"ZFC_FmL\">FmL</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ L3AtomRow z4805 z4806 z4807)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmL|FmL]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmL","status":"resolved","id":"2599832c1bfb4f3c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","exc